  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/351351/Spheres-Apocrypha-Monster-Traditions?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Banners</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Diplomacy 10 ranks, Warleader sphere (Heraldry), banner class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> An ally who benefits from a tactic you create is considered to be within range of your banner and receives its benefits accordingly.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc97\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
